---
// Withdrawals.astro - Retiros de ganancias estilo nocnoc (lenguaje directo, botones oficiales)
import Button from './Button.astro';
import { SITE_CONFIG } from '../config';
---
<section class="withdraw-section block-light" id="retiros">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="withdraw-grid">
      <!-- Columna Izquierda: Información de Cobro -->
      <div class="withdraw-info-card">
        <div>
          <h2>Retira directo a tu banco o billetera digital</h2>
          <p class="withdraw-intro">
            Cobros procesados de forma inmediata mediante el método oficial <strong>1XBET Cash</strong>.
          </p>

          <div class="steps-flow">
            <div class="step-flow-item">
              <span class="step-badge">1</span>
              <div class="step-flow-text">
                <strong>Solicita el retiro en 1xBet</strong>
                <p>En tu app o web de 1xBet ve a "Retirar fondos" y elige el método <strong>1XBET Cash</strong>.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="step-flow-item">
              <span class="step-badge">2</span>
              <div class="step-flow-text">
                <strong>Ingresa los datos exactos de nuestra caja</strong>
                <p>Indica tu monto y selecciona obligatoriamente estos datos:</p>
                <div class="cash-data-box">
                  <div class="cash-data-row"><span>País:</span> <strong>Bolivia</strong></div>
                  <div class="cash-data-row"><span>Ciudad:</span> <strong>Cochabamba <small>(o Кочабамба)</small></strong></div>
                  <div class="cash-data-row"><span>Calle / Dirección:</span> <strong>Zencash (Coliseo san Francisco)</strong></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="step-flow-item">
              <span class="step-badge">3</span>
              <div class="step-flow-text">
                <strong>Obtén tu código de retiro</strong>
                <p>En "Solicitudes de retiro", cuando figure en estado <strong>Aprobado (Approved)</strong>, presiona <strong>"Obtener código"</strong> y cópialo.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="step-flow-item">
              <span class="step-badge">4</span>
              <div class="step-flow-text">
                <strong>Envíanos tus datos por WhatsApp o Telegram</strong>
                <p>Mándanos tu <strong>ID de 1xBet</strong>, tu <strong>Código de retiro</strong> y tu <strong>QR de cobro</strong> o cuenta de banco.</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="step-flow-item">
              <span class="step-badge">5</span>
              <div class="step-flow-text">
                <strong>¡Recibe tu dinero al instante!</strong>
                <p>Validamos tu solicitud en el sistema y te transferimos tus fondos en 2 a 5 minutos.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="withdraw-actions">
          <Button 
            href="https://wa.me/59176996388?text=Hola%20Zencash,%20deseo%20hacer%20un%20retiro%20de%20mis%20ganancias%20de%201xBet" 
            variant="primary" 
            on="light"
            size="lg"
            class="withdraw-btn"
          >
            SOLICITAR RETIRO POR WHATSAPP
          </Button>

          <Button 
            href={SITE_CONFIG.telegramDirect} 
            variant="telegram" 
            on="light"
            size="lg"
            class="withdraw-btn"
          >
            SOLICITAR POR TELEGRAM
          </Button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Columna Derecha: Tarjeta de Solvencia y Verificación Oficial -->
      <div class="liquidity-banner">
        <div class="tag-cajero">
          <span>AGENTE OFICIAL 1XBET</span>
        </div>

        <h3>Tu seguridad es nuestra prioridad</h3>
        
        <div class="agent-verify-card">
          <div class="verify-badge-row">
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#FFB800" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
              <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/>
              <polyline points="9 12 11 14 15 10"/>
            </svg>
            <strong>Agente Oficial Verificado</strong>
          </div>
          <p>
            ¿Quieres comprobar nuestra autenticidad? Solicítanos una verificación y recibirás un mensaje interno oficial de 1xBet en tu cuenta confirmando: <em>"Agent Approved / Agente Verificado"</em>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="liquidity-features">
          <div class="l-feature">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#FFB800" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span>Retiros transferidos en 2 a 5 minutos</span>
          </div>
          <div class="l-feature">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#FFB800" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span>Comprobante bancario oficial de cada transferencia</span>
          </div>
          <div class="l-feature">
            <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#FFB800" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"></polyline>
            </svg>
            <span>Liquidez permanente en todos los bancos de Bolivia</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="cashier-active-note">
          <span class="active-dot"></span>
          <span>Cajeros de guardia activos ahora mismo</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .withdraw-section {
    padding: var(--space-16) 0 var(--space-20);
  }

  .withdraw-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.2fr 0.8fr;
    gap: var(--space-8);
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .withdraw-info-card {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-white);
    border: 1.5px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: var(--space-10);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-6);
  }

  .withdraw-info-card h2 {
    color: var(--color-text-dark);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .withdraw-intro {
    font-size: var(--font-size-md);
    color: var(--color-text-body);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  .withdraw-intro strong {
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .steps-flow {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
  }

  .step-flow-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .step-badge {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background-color: var(--color-primary);
    color: var(--color-text-white);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-black);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .step-flow-text strong {
    display: block;
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
    color: var(--color-text-dark);
    margin-bottom: 2px;
  }

  .step-flow-text p {
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
  }

  .cash-data-box {
    background-color: var(--color-primary-light);
    border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-3);
    margin-top: 6px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3px;
  }

  .cash-data-row {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--color-text-body);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
  }

  .cash-data-row strong {
    color: var(--color-primary-dark);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
  }

  .cash-data-row small {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-weight: normal;
  }

  .withdraw-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .withdraw-btn {
    width: auto !important;
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  /* Columna Derecha */
  .liquidity-banner {
    background-color: var(--color-primary);
    color: var(--color-text-white);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: var(--space-10);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: var(--space-6);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-elevated);
  }

  .tag-cajero {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    background-color: var(--color-accent-yellow);
    color: #1A1300;
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-black);
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    width: fit-content;
  }

  .liquidity-banner h3 {
    font-size: var(--font-size-2xl);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-extrabold);
    color: var(--color-text-white);
  }

  .agent-verify-card {
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-5);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .verify-badge-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    color: var(--color-accent-yellow);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
  }

  .verify-badge-row strong {
    color: var(--color-text-white);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
  }

  .agent-verify-card p {
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    line-height: var(--leading-normal);
    color: var(--color-text-blue-light);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .agent-verify-card em {
    color: var(--color-accent-yellow);
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
  }

  .liquidity-features {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-3);
  }

  .l-feature {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
    color: var(--color-text-white);
  }

  .cashier-active-note {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    font-size: var(--font-size-xs);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
    color: var(--color-text-white);
    background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
    padding: var(--space-2) var(--space-4);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    width: fit-content;
  }

  .active-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background-color: var(--color-accent-yellow);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .withdraw-section {
      padding: var(--space-10) 0 var(--space-12);
    }

    .withdraw-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .withdraw-info-card,
    .liquidity-banner {
      padding: var(--space-6);
    }
  }
</style>
